orget all this after  i told them my story and there's no part  of me that has a problem with that some  things are better left forgotten but  before the scp foundation wipes it all  away from my mind and i get to go live  with my beloved wife once more this was  how i survived 100 dreadful days in the  infinite ikea now go check out how to  actually beat scp-3008 the infinite ikea  and surviving inside scp-3008 the  infinite ikea for more of this swedish  flat pack hellscape

